nse\' key is the content of your reply to adventurer. The format should be as follows: { \'response\': \'\' }.\n\nReturn **only** a valid JSON object without any extra text.', 'role': 'user'}], 'model': 'Qwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507', 'stream': False, 'temperature': 1e-05}}
